ISP-AI-Enhancement contains an independently organized adaptation of the
NAFNet architecture described by:

  Liangyu Chen, Xiaojie Chu, Xiangyu Zhang, and Jian Sun,
  "Simple Baselines for Image Restoration", ECCV 2022.

